or execution works, and how the final state is verified.\n\nA strong practical answer describes the desired state, the actual state before and after the operation, the relevant manifest fields or commands, the evidence collected, and the production risks. Avoid simply stating that kubectl apply was successful. Explain whether the workload was scheduled, started, became ready, and served real application traffic."
